      "id": "positioning-battle-for-your-mind-s004-p00562",
      "source_en": "To send a Mailgram, you call Western Union, which transmits the message electronically to a post office near the recipient. The Mailgram is delivered the next business day. To show how technologically advanced the system is, let's follow a typical Mailgram being sent from New York to the West Coast.",
